          Dental treatments
          Care for every stage of your smile
          
            From your first examination to treatment and aftercare, the clinic
            focuses on helping you understand your options and move forward confidently.
          
        

        
          
            01
            Dental implants
            
              Implant-focused consultation and treatment planning for replacing
              missing teeth and restoring everyday function.
            
          

          
            02
            Root canal treatment
            
              Assessment and treatment for infected or damaged tooth pulp, with
              the procedure, appointments and aftercare explained clearly.
            
          

          
            03
            Ceramic crowns & bridges
            
              Restorative options for strengthening damaged teeth or replacing
              missing teeth, planned around your clinical needs.
            
          

          
            04
            Tooth extraction
            
              Evaluation and extraction care, including impacted tooth cases
              where extraction is clinically appropriate.
            
          

          
            05
            Dental consultation
            
              Discuss your symptoms or concerns, receive an examination and
              understand the most suitable next steps for your oral health.
            
          

          
            06
            Not sure what you need?
            
              Call the clinic and describe your concern. The team can guide you
              on scheduling an appropriate consultation.
            
          
        

        
          Treatment suitability, timelines and costs vary between patients.
