          Frequently asked questions
          Before your appointment
        

        
          Where is the clinic located?
          
            The clinic is at Surya Complex, Pratham Tal, in front of Sai Hospital,
            Chauraha, Mukhani, Haldwani, Uttarakhand 263139. Use the “Get directions”
            button above to open the location in Google Maps.
          
        

        
          Which treatments can I ask about?
          
            You can contact the clinic regarding dental consultations, dental implants,
            root canal treatment, ceramic crowns and bridges, and tooth extractions,
            including impacted tooth cases. Your dentist will confirm suitability after
            an examination.
          
        

        
          Is root canal treatment painful?
          
            Several patient reviews describe their root canal experience as painless.
            However, every patient and clinical situation is different. The dentist can
            explain the procedure, comfort measures and aftercare during your consultation.
          
        

        
          How do I confirm clinic hours?
          
            Please call 099979 83541 before visiting. The team can confirm current
            opening hours and help you find an available appointment time.
          
        
      
    
  

  
    
      
